Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.45,0:00:06.41,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去寻找吧 收集起梦的碎片{\fad(250,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.45,0:00:17.59,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使胸中苦闷 去感受真切的现在吧{\fad(0,400)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.46,0:00:22.43,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比外表更单纯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.34,0:00:26.03,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是却无法传达
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.97,0:00:33.47,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想要说的话 总是藏在口袋里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.28,0:00:40.01,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,充满孩子气的话语 如今已无法开口
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.65,0:00:47.99,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽说时间会冲淡一切 我们却无法相互理解
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.16,0:00:54.26,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,24小时 一直相信着你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.43,0:00:58.03,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看着你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.17,0:01:02.77,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使只是俗常的话语
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.18,0:01:09.05,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,时间总是 微笑着匆匆流逝
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.32,0:01:20.52,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比起回忆 还是去追求理想的今天{\fad(0,1025)}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.07,0:02:14.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,城主大人…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.49,0:02:33.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就是黑巫女 椿吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.62,0:02:35.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果是前来阻挠咒术的话
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.76,0:02:37.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经太迟了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.33,0:02:39.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,诅咒老早就结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.56,0:02:42.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是那样的 我是来接你的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.10,0:02:44.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是妖怪吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.17,0:02:46.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别这样
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.17,0:02:50.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是难伺候的老太婆
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.54,0:02:53.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过我们想借用一下那股力量
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.74,0:02:56.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖怪找我有什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.48,0:02:59.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还很痛恨桔梗对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.98,0:03:04.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.85,0:03:10.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第60话 黑巫女 五十年的诅咒
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.30,0:03:23.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.47,0:03:27.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,完全看不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.78,0:03:29.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,完全看不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.21,0:03:32.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,完全看不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.32,0:03:36.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下一个你念念看 日暮同学
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.23,0:03:49.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以前学过的也忘光了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.23,0:03:52.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我好像愈来愈被抛在后面了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.90,0:03:56.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇没什么精神呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.67,0:03:59.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然是那个 旧男友的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.17,0:04:01.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是那个明明劈腿甩掉戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.74,0:04:04.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又爱吃醋的暴力任性男人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.78,0:04:06.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定是还牵扯不清
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.39,0:04:13.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打起精神嘛 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.09,0:04:15.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点忘了他比较好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.12,0:04:18.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是嘛 那个臭男人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.36,0:04:20.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,男人…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.00,0:04:22.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.86,0:04:24.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他果然不想分手对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.27,0:04:26.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要干脆点分了才行
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.20,0:04:28.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊…那个呀…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.94,0:04:29.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们两个…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.70,0:04:31.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又发生什么了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.44,0:04:33.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像又和好了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.51,0:04:37.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又回到原点了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.08,0:04:39.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和那个男的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.45,0:04:41.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实他也有温柔的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.88,0:04:42.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.95,0:04:43.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很平常嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.09,0:04:46.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那为什么这么沮丧呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.32,0:04:47.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我最近一直请假
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.16,0:04:49.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,课业有点…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.82,0:04:52.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来如此 因为戈薇常常请假
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.16,0:04:56.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算每天上课也有可能跟不上
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.83,0:04:58.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说的也是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.67,0:05:03.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是只要确实做好预习与复习
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.11,0:05:05.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上课就能很快乐吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.98,0:05:09.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么怎么怎么？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.24,0:05:11.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说了不好的话吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.55,0:05:12.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.98,0:05:14.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为步美一直很认真
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.48,0:05:16.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得走了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.05,0:05:17.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是太晚的话
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.69,0:05:19.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙又会跑来接我的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.49,0:05:21.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他还会来接你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.49,0:05:23.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那真的是很体贴的男朋友呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.06,0:05:26.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不对 他明明很爱吃醋
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.26,0:05:28.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且很任性
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.63,0:05:30.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.13,0:05:33.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们又和好了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.20,0:05:35.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇这样没问题吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.00,0:05:37.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.38,0:05:45.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是致密的结界
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.01,0:05:48.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抓紧了 老太婆
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.39,0:05:58.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落 我找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.23,0:06:00.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.90,0:06:03.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,黑巫女 椿
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.17,0:06:08.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找我来到底有什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.60,0:06:11.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大约五十年前 你应该还记得
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.24,0:06:13.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,曾和叫做桔梗的巫女战斗吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.74,0:06:15.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了夺取四魂之玉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.88,0:06:17.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道的真清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.05,0:06:19.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是很久以前的事了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.12,0:06:21.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,黑巫女 椿
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.05,0:06:23.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你那邪恶的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.05,0:06:26.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,愿意为我所用吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.25,0:06:27.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.76,0:06:30.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,借给你力量 我能得到什么
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.13,0:06:32.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就给你四魂之玉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.99,0:06:34.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.02,0:06:56.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂之玉…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.15,0:06:59.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在你的手上吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.22,0:07:00.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老太婆变的妖怪？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.96,0:07:03.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,注意你的口气
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.53,0:07:05.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是我本来的面貌
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.09,0:07:07.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看这个女人的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.86,0:07:08.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是为了永保青春
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.16,0:07:11.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把魂魄出卖给妖怪吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.80,0:07:14.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且对方还是不怎样的妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.94,0:07:18.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这女人应该渴望更强的妖力
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.74,0:07:20.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然你说有四魂之玉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.81,0:07:22.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就先让我看看
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.24,0:07:25.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你打算用四魂之玉做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.68,0:07:29.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该不会是永保青春吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.19,0:07:37.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落 你希望我做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.56,0:07:41.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是给七宝的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.50,0:07:43.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是犬夜叉喜欢的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.70,0:07:46.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别只顾着拿零嘴…拿去
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.14,0:07:49.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像这样的也该带一些
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.47,0:07:51.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你 妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.71,0:07:55.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有很多各式各样的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.08,0:07:57.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.21,0:07:59.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.51,0:08:01.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,御神酒和护身符也带去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.98,0:08:04.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些不用了啦 爷爷
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.35,0:08:06.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.02,0:08:11.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,姐姐 你已经要出发了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.09,0:08:13.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为有人在等呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.60,0:08:15.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是犬夜叉哥哥？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.43,0:08:16.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家都在等
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.80,0:08:19.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也想试着去战国时代
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.87,0:08:22.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算你去了 因为你是胆小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.17,0:08:23.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马上就会想回来的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.87,0:08:25.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.31,0:08:26.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,草太年纪还太小了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.11,0:08:28.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,姐姐就不会怕吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.11,0:08:32.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大概都已经习惯了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.35,0:08:36.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好重
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.75,0:08:38.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没问题吧 姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.09,0:08:42.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没办法
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.26,0:08:45.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个就放着吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.40,0:08:51.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有够久耶 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.13,0:08:55.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明明说太阳下山前就会回来的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.27,0:08:57.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇好慢啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.77,0:09:01.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明明说太阳下山前就会回来的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.01,0:09:07.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你干什么啦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.15,0:09:08.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少罗唆
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.29,0:09:12.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,臭家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.39,0:09:15.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.92,0:09:18.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有感觉到什么吧 七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.66,0:09:20.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不太清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.27,0:09:31.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有股奇怪的气味
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.08,0:09:40.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个感觉…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.05,0:09:43.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,枫姥姥
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.45,0:09:44.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是法师啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.45,0:09:47.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,您也发现了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.32,0:09:50.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊…邪气悄悄的接近中
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.43,0:09:54.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,仿佛在地面上爬一样
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.10,0:09:56.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.20,0:09:57.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.97,0:10:04.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好重喔
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.98,0:10:11.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.98,0:10:14.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么？被咬了？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.85,0:10:19.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是是什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.46,0:10:24.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么都没有呀
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.46,0:10:27.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 很慢耶
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.63,0:10:28.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.70,0:10:30.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道被什么东西咬了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.23,0:10:31.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.84,0:10:37.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.24,0:10:40.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,散魂铁爪
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.48,0:10:44.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,纸？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.40,0:11:02.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.77,0:11:06.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拿到那女人的血了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.73,0:11:08.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,完成了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.37,0:11:09.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.64,0:11:12.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么 再带我过去一趟吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.17,0:11:13.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很神气嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.79,0:11:27.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我碰到一个奇怪的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.79,0:11:29.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该算是解决掉了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.94,0:11:46.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接下来就交给我
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.44,0:11:48.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 随便你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.97,0:12:13.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是真的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.80,0:12:15.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是没有被咬的痕迹
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.84,0:12:16.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像是耶
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.60,0:12:17.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.34,0:12:20.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,的确有个奇怪的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.81,0:12:23.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我看看那纸 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.71,0:12:24.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.35,0:12:29.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,话说回来 戈薇？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.62,0:12:31.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有带来啦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.49,0:12:36.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拿去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.49,0:12:39.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是这个
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.36,0:12:44.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.24,0:12:48.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个大家一起吃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.14,0:12:51.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个是…式神
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.77,0:12:52.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,式神？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.51,0:12:57.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚刚是…四魂之玉碎片？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.01,0:12:59.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么了 戈薇？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.35,0:13:00.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.35,0:13:06.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,碎片变黑了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.03,0:13:16.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.90,0:13:18.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.53,0:13:22.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,碎片 进入了我的身体里？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.51,0:13:26.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.41,0:13:30.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,进入那女人体内的四魂碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.31,0:13:33.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会和充满奈落污秽的玉共鸣
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.41,0:13:35.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而侵蚀那个女人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.92,0:13:39.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管是心灵还是身体
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.66,0:13:41.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么一来
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.82,0:13:45.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那女人的命运就任我摆布了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.69,0:13:49.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,椿 别小看那个叫戈薇的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.40,0:13:50.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,笑死人了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.80,0:13:51.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个叫戈薇的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.83,0:13:54.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,连自己中了诅咒都没发觉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.94,0:13:57.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本以为桔梗的转世
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.17,0:13:59.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是个多厉害的角色
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.81,0:14:00.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了 你想怎么做？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.08,0:14:02.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就这样直接咒杀她也行
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.08,0:14:04.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.71,0:14:10.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让犬夜叉的恶梦再次重现吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.45,0:14:12.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那与心爱的女人相互残杀
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.42,0:14:14.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让人怀念的梦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.32,0:14:16.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,振作一点 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.72,0:14:17.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,振作一点
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.06,0:14:19.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.73,0:14:21.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,枫姥姥 这是…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.60,0:14:23.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,加上之前的邪气
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.60,0:14:26.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道是某人在诅咒戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.07,0:14:30.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁敢诅咒戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.47,0:14:33.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能是黑巫女的杰作
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.44,0:14:35.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在井边咬伤戈薇的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.38,0:14:38.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该是黑巫女的使魔 式神
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.45,0:14:39.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,黑巫女？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.61,0:14:41.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.22,0:14:43.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你应该也知道她们的存在吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.49,0:14:47.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,专门接受诅咒委托的邪恶巫女
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.76,0:14:49.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂碎片受到污染
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.36,0:14:51.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也是那家伙的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.63,0:14:54.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,完全进入戈薇的身体里了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.50,0:14:55.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再这样下去
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.26,0:14:57.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇或许会被碎片的毒毒死
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.40,0:14:59.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧 珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.00,0:15:03.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找出黑巫女然后打倒她
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.37,0:15:05.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要断绝诅咒非这样做不可
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.64,0:15:07.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么我也要去
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.41,0:15:09.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.64,0:15:12.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你留下来陪在戈薇身边
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.65,0:15:14.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样比较妥当
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.78,0:15:15.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.93,0:15:25.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从这个方向可以感受到邪气
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.53,0:15:29.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坐上来 弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.77,0:15:35.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托你们了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.94,0:15:38.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.94,0:15:42.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀了他
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.64,0:15:43.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.68,0:15:45.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀了他
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.15,0:15:46.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀了谁
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.65,0:15:50.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀了犬夜叉 杀了犬夜叉！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.83,0:15:59.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀了他
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.56,0:16:00.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.93,0:16:02.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀了他
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.33,0:16:03.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀了谁
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.93,0:16:06.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀了犬夜叉！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.43,0:16:09.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要…别说了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.98,0:16:17.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然还任性的抵抗着
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.68,0:16:19.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说过了 椿
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.48,0:16:22.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个叫戈薇的女人 是巫女桔梗的转世
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.08,0:16:25.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,普通的手段是行不通的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.22,0:16:29.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.36,0:16:32.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个女人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.86,0:16:35.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那时候的桔梗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.23,0:16:37.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被一个半妖男人夺去了心
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.50,0:16:39.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,灵力也衰弱了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.87,0:16:42.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,夺取那家伙守护的四魂之玉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.47,0:16:44.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这原本是最好的机会
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.75,0:16:53.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.12,0:16:58.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那女人竟然把我放的式神
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.85,0:17:00.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原封不动的打回来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.06,0:17:08.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快滚 我不想取你性命
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.83,0:17:12.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那女人故作清高的脸
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.97,0:17:16.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在回想起来仍让我作呕
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.28,0:17:27.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.05,0:17:29.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.78,0:17:31.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.46,0:17:42.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了 我去换个水
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.71,0:17:52.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在那边
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.81,0:17:54.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点 弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.32,0:18:03.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇还有救吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.58,0:18:06.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊…可能戈薇本身
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.82,0:18:09.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正在和诅咒战斗吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.56,0:18:11.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇是很坚强的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.59,0:18:12.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.53,0:18:17.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是 再拖下去会承受不了的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.30,0:18:23.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还束手无策吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.54,0:18:25.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算她垂死挣扎也差不多到极限了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.31,0:18:31.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧 奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.81,0:18:34.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就实现你的愿望吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.12,0:18:41.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,浑蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.62,0:18:44.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒他们还没 抵达黑巫女的所在吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.10,0:19:00.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.37,0:19:03.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇明明这么痛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.34,0:19:05.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我居然只能旁观
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.92,0:19:18.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.63,0:19:33.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死吧 犬夜叉！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.64,0:19:36.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.07,0:19:39.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀了犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.38,0:19:42.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快逃…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.38,0:19:43.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀了他
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.81,0:19:47.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快逃 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.38,0:19:49.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 你…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.59,0:19:53.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是顽强
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.65,0:19:55.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使身体被操纵
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.36,0:19:57.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自己的心却还没丧失
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.89,0:20:02.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 这样更有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.36,0:20:07.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,椿 如果犬夜叉逃离那地方
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.10,0:20:12.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到时候就不用客气 咒杀戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.57,0:20:13.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快逃
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.48,0:20:17.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇一定是被黑巫女操纵了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.62,0:20:27.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还没好吗 弥勒
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.42,0:20:30.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,邪气愈来愈强了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.09,0:20:32.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点 云母
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.37,0:20:40.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是那个
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.38,0:20:49.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.95,0:20:54.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.53,0:21:07.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我感觉到了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.67,0:21:22.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这股邪气
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.24,0:21:24.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我曾经和它战斗过
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.75,0:21:34.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那女人我随时都能咒杀她
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.49,0:21:38.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 你要怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.66,0:21:41.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就这样让戈薇杀了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.26,0:21:44.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是逃走 让戈薇丧命呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.30,0:21:48.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快…逃
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.51,0:21:53.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.98,0:21:58.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尽量痛苦吧 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.51,0:21:59.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点逃
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.41,0:22:01.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.35,0:22:29.35,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,何不把真正重要的事物以外{\fad(500,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.86,0:22:40.83,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全部 都舍弃呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.11,0:22:48.31,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现实 往往是如此残酷
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.38,0:22:52.08,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但每当 遇到这种时刻
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.18,0:22:56.81,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只要紧闭双眼
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.02,0:23:03.36,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,便能看见 你的笑容{\fad(0,900)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.56,0:23:10.86,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Ah- 但愿从此以往
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.04,0:23:18.60,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直到进入 沉眠的那一刻
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.41,0:23:26.04,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的 那抹笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.88,0:23:33.88,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都绝没有 消逝的瞬间{\fad(0,900)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.07,0:23:48.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇姑娘在倒下之前
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.90,0:23:50.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,曾经说她被什么咬了一口
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.97,0:23:53.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那可能就是黑巫女的式神
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.57,0:23:54.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师快点
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.81,0:23:57.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尽快找到她的所在位置 然后阻止她
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.18,0:23:58.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不然戈薇会将犬夜叉…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.35,0:24:00.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是这个结界太强了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.68,0:24:02.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,光凭我的力量是不够的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.58,0:24:03.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是…
